  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "銷鋒鑄耜，休牛放馬。甲兵解散，夫婦相保。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b53bafae641493445411132b5261ede792b7de4dc7e37d0a69ce724a866552d1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b48ea064ae5c1210639e229a23525dbcf983489fc107918f9e72aa7a08da37a8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "一衣三冠，冠無所絆。衣服不成，為身災患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e676140abdbf68668d860729260901a49a601552079a3f5282571c06a6876883",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c3ab58c75dc2c2ccb48d124ff500a592e1f084dbbfcd1f9ccd61e92e5965af6f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "百足俱行，相輔為彊。三聖翼事，王室寵光。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:634a35993a5a40e354b559b39ba9537d113946fc052db08da019e5751ef27ea1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e0c5a7c9fe0992c7ac37ff29e2f217d6764947e2e3a9e19b65f8e221403df24a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "魚蛇之恠，大人憂懼。梁君好城，失其安居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:72393a59acdafba06e1b38140e180bf6921c74fbe641b00015c967b9d6b5cba0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:36a950f22aff3299b8460b1f89321783622709301a996a149faf2f844b545181"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "少無彊輔，長不見母。勞心遠思，自傷憂苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:272200b15b7cb964266573988d1b1860a0440c72a2ac62e4f4cb45b7fa9e05e4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b4c113acde169687e468d70f3a7224dead63ae9eafae67a85468f83374c1688b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "前不溽暑，解不可取。離門二里，敗我利市。老牛病馬，去之何悔。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f255424d793cd6e1882f845ec9ce69753ebc0ae99d4d1bdf3ee520ef3bef99ad",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8fba8d0b53cf6cacd1b6d9796d870b5b9d4eaf108c6cd7740a2745f1f431d3f1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "君明有德，登天大祿。布政施惠，以成恩福。中子南遊，翱翔未復。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:af8c98b0a3c4c3c1bbc4da031f5686797085d1e97f026b85ed9b8325d641d138",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a84748d43d54948d0670d4d7ab3ed7cbccee6aac9f75ff09bf741b4a8c5a83ec"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "嘵然唯諾，敬上尊客。執恭除患，禦侮致福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fd50193eb2511c59f4deee6c151803c0d0d0eab4bae27cde2d32b5dc2d3934c7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:17129f88f0f2445f536e13049d5f705ea450f806bc1f84e7313523d0ce7a32dc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "黍稷禾稻，垂秀方造。中旱不雨，傷風病槁。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9ff4e86dd34400787c66252956df3b949cdbd71d7d3ba07796b2bc322214dc30",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2393fb6938ad8d586bf7c67ccbd253b0f170616473ff26a24aff40a627bd581e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "三羸六罷，不能越跪。東賈失馬，往反勞苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d3fb6336efd431b39f499ad75f8dfb559eeab4a6fa0b448b44d14a80ba27d5f2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8b39e6dba94768e09c9dd1eb3ac99a7857b03f9c7b450518b1edaa69160ddafc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "倚立相望，引衣欲裝。陰雲蔽日，暴雨降集。使道不通，阻我歡會。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c94100910760fa75e1ae066133f9db369eb0ac7f5b646a02d12d79a23bf360b6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a66b8079c751839dd573556af6930b88bdc31b046fe4fc64605a1ac3275a16b0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "高腳疾步，受肩喜趨。日走千里，賈市有得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e81b794c7cf7e323b0eace54b08c8e4e1d5716437e7212cf34517e4fd18dad06",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:df1135d085aac228ca0db3206a605fd8f090aa9125e2d94945f7d1f9d23a40ce"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "北風寒涼，雨雪盈冰。憂思不樂，哀悲傷心。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0cb384fffdd0518e64e2d8e02e3a1a3c6bf92c8e4cabb7d7ba20dbd5c9b4daba",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2a98557793372e93163483da333e06f6f957ca283457aba6ecaaf93a8405398a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "貞鳥雎鳩，執一無尤。寢門治理，君子悅喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a34b63809644c17386692d48fc5de728119b833ca8714bb2bd839751f5d6daf7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1b8410560d9f186d337a89cb302b5bcd153ca7e264625c6048c16f4752d5a105"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "蓼蕭露瀼，君子寵光。鳴鸞噰噰，福祿來同。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8a3d7d61f22a241b9d12b2f0ac6f3f7ffea95b316103ac08c5ed2050627ff724",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5c70a4a180960ddfc5ebae18a48e72e0554a46f1dbb467b1d5fd785e656566c8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "南行求福，與喜相得。受封上賞，鼎足輔國。（咸之恒同。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:03dd6666256814694275b88ad4a56a46f4ccae96af573447a7bd088996954cd3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e2e2aca157754443a2924df846ceef196acfa13a6f5ad68084222b1c6b3c8341"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "桑華腐蠹，衣敝如絡。女功不成，絲布為玉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:59e509b1a8b6932fe73baac9a17c6016439be5224dfcb3ec1415d9740508b13a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9e1d67fd7523eceea76dfb98fcec8133f30f77549b62d361cf1c87b9e98e7031"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "左服易右，王良心歡，喜利從己。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:77b03dbdcebe252e8ce00257143880b492c4e9d803260603d70e50d97995aa10",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:22227b0dbb5442bf0de59a8c0fdff0b94a8bc4b240c7d26fd6e00f2f16fd70df"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "壽考不忘，駕駟東行。三適陳宋，南賈楚荊。得利息長，旅身多罷。畏晝喜夜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a2b4cf79c75f911b871c8dc0ad2bb5b8b8185b9bc2f8209454867f73af1c9436",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:66636866d32a28b60978307d44f923bfbc6347577fd644998c0b302a9f833e2d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "羔羊皮弁，君子朝服。輔政扶德，以合萬國。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ccc946879586229a133c09163d34809c69a859ecfad1fae0ff1d6a49b19c7398",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8277b2cb720b4e5b02c7d6c69b8a40643781eec34b7bfc1b2237d2a951fbd181"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "鸇鳩徙巢，西至平州。遭逢雷電，破全葦蘆。室家飢寒，思吾故初。全一作我。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:33ab59afc6cc26317987093d0285b5bb41f5fb066dbb8b779c9b395bc4a786d3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c75c8f9c532b5eea7cd27681f671d9563d7bc55316a78009ba53bbe564f276d8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "大尾小頭，重不可搖。上弱下彊，陰制其雄。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:682e5b1e00a179d962f7dacdd9a239d3ed261ed30970dc25c82f86be5bc30f91",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fa8d92b27bcccdf964fbb95279299ca22780fccf0a0685cc4d04f2786a79cde3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "疏足息肩，有所忌難。金城銅郭，以鐵為關。藩屏自衛，安心無患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3163934a2e9bd0546d92f83bcd6d27eeacde00cc2b5d29418c524bf9ad679314",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:614a2c492f553e69ca7d0c9d2b014000b131b0d0cc403497a8b74105ce905e2a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "天命元鳥，下生大商。造定四表，享國久長。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4a816bfe755a4649629a08f0aa0a5691bfaf57404521e5a057d1e2d93958c7ed",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4572a849964f58d50e3d358120bc5dde6c22d4ae6045228f348a354ac2fa93b6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "賦斂重數，政為民賊。杼軸空虛，我去其室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:be951d3b1986efcc03bb8e12e0f7fa5bd675559badda593c2692c7025bfe6063",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bce43cc6a62c344da6e543183abba09dc0d38922d044e033e6eb7e52edfa8898"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "陰陽隔塞，許嫁不答。宛丘新臺，悔往嘆息。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d9ee4f95086bf61cc1fe44cc1b92bc8d8aa8bf2abc23d292084689ff36d0a36f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e2a8ced06445d6e6a06739c87d00d85a0834645cd895be7c3c43f49c89ee9563"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "願望登虛，意常欲迯。賈辛醜惡，妻不安夫。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f7b633b7a71bda14a99136113060af5bb2457c963bf9a97293f068108b21efc8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f8cb2c3e0bea9f8638843d2a49806822b061dd61b165bf0b7310ca8fb072fbb6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "踄行竊視，有所畏避。蔽目伏藏，以夜為利。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d7e78e265070b9086d3fc7d273803f51e2d1c0f478957815d1914bcf9d0976cf",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e113c377b2000a774a1943dddc9aa7076f24ea2ee71f3a88cabd76f411fc9a37"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "信敏恭謙，敬鬼尊神。五岳四瀆，克厭帝心。受福宜年。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9286bc87fd0f931cc5a1a004910e32cec8604ea314fefb0bd46b1a44e2d8ab30",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fcd282e35115dda1a5c90bda273b1b948edd95357f94b3236949f669f8c6c7dd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "懸懸南海，去家萬里。飛兔腰褭。一日見母，除我憂悔。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:04bef90c94b7775319a631cb6ad65e86c24b67be28d4ef637eac804d0b7c293a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:80e4a068290da9dacc33eef3a0c29f8d2bfd6a11529817f444c058b2ae4ae9f9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "雖污不辱，因何跣足。童子褰衣，五步平復。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4e502806e5022cdcb4665da355e505ebc7a11172f5f51b1432eae9fd1682ab59",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c8f75d9d34fcfd36b85974e40ef0320a6738e93b5474dbc33af38993dc1356b2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "宮城立見，衣就袂裾。恭謙自衛，終無禍尤。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b44f317dd8c5f2c305b88d69bc52c13022b4dfe66871fb77b1be5c7ee71e4c4e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0b4906590b1facbf94b09caa47030366a771a12b677e1f5c46333aff5f295272"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "敝笱在梁，不能得魚。望食千里，所至空虛。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:30c4c203057a4446747fa13575539245b90c16fc64be50628219f410ad6ff9d6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5d00bbf9f7f94752d8f4bf9cb9a21b7771ce668ed029bbb06d8872bcbaa6081a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "千里騂駒，為王服車。嘉其驪榮，君子有成。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:295ae6334479b9b46cd1e996762b6138f57a0dc07e3a4094fe5e9fe2ac738ad4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ed10baf3e4ee1642cb90d1c56d6846cde44e6d653bf6d56259bd88b6fabf5e7e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "鼎足承德，嘉謀生福。為王開庭，得心所欲。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fafef43906e75ce0c6af1b9c871b63e6bf0ec10b7ef2c820b2e60d64342ad63a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d1cd760ee83cccdec13a0cbc91115cfebf0761f885ddf8235cd9a41c88a02e24"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "右手無合，獨折左指。禹湯失位，事功弗立。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fdedd053895bf9ab76af5c4fc2a588f59647b2c13f8f55c5af352b426c9e9e48",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:13b7b8ed10deb49c0d97e66b68e8d8999d4b672cc7efb9f836e71778c019a7f1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "憂凶增累，患近不解。心西意東，事無成功。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a250530278b3f9ae8f3853cc06589556efdc47cccf57d3e11ba2ee38e3ab6c1b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:27b24038860c7f8ccb3bb547273ed9effb9ff4f51a862984fa0ca04f82e80ac9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "東行食榆，困於枯株。夫妻無家，志窮為憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c47d6b356a0e43d595ff034de615d89e7080f30b5e08bbfea49c15b0d8b51bb4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a7cb753f02c6bd27777a4886177e52c636419532e39c8fc7f6887f8cdfa68dd2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "五經六紀，仁道所在。正月繁霜，獨不離咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:36a1aed0e27ed8c3f3b050074bd0357d048b440ff19395219f5b261dd00a9945",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bc0be614d85834b1fc89e49407225d050b422df12bdde71aa201fad134248857"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "懈緩不前，怠墮失便。二至之戒，家無禍凶。刻木象形，聞言不信。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:441485714f3ba9c054c214739e4ee322c5660706d65487f2e914e96f4f4fc05f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:63555033feabd808694fe24843040fa3b11ea3cf22108a8fe429efa1d9e6a556"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "仁愛篤厚，不以所忿，害其所子。徙我舊都，日益富有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9e1ab07e9adaec2f751f4912a529a87e38e43d8916a80d241a04ec5cb91bc7e7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:902b40473709d1a3a9848bbee21cc2bffc7a4583809b18abf22e2f6f5f4b9b1b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "缺破不成，胎卵未生，弗見兆形。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:94253ab06c014655f3d05b7546a86490f0259e429eb5ab95a88f5c9a4869879e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2b889a9afdd47f9689ec675976cc02192df717aa235264dd00e6699b197e12f0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "摧角不傷，雖折復長。秉德無愆，老賴榮光。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3b4841c39ffc532e9628c2f552a27410afbd6aec40f1496a100aab8ff8ee78c9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:07fcbb5a6888fe5478813f35b7ee85f2f4af53dff134a43b5dd88cafa67a5656"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "乘桴浮海，免脫厄中，雖困無凶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7e669205a711df00ae168f6f4b04ffb336614cc21ba17f8cb47eb8006e21ff69",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9b9810a89b2f934037aac286a4f479f6b59e383ee92563e7e6dd38c82c21e797"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "孔鸞鴛雛，鴞鸃鵜鴣，翱翔紫淵。嘉禾之國，君子以說。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:74e665ae572dc5a4fd68136ade5f413001d267aaf61815f48756a719c8edf8b2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:845aae3b4b017769458a4633503d3aa01a2d6ddfde257eb954134c823d04f8c8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "甘露溫潤，眾來得願。樂易君子，不逢禍亂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:aa96a3a7373b22aba71091ef94f042c982f7083b047faf7c35cf3e0cf04749f2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4c5d73e02ca397b4dc2fe1c7f5f6a6249940ea0bdd92bc174850fbe3dcc8dbaf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "東騎墮落，千里獨宿。高岸為谷，陽失其室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7c33e8f09a0e6f4e152cf573c63d07c05e1661a026af02e2c54079a34b6d5ded",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6e8e336158849c186cc43f6a8ea065dc219b7627b305db81f1fd75da1eb02ab9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "入村既登，以成嘉功。尨降庭堅，國無災凶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f78f2f3dc01ccd2d4fbd40204f47127b0d60e5bbf71f2394c0a2aec9d465ed58",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a3a9071d71c47d1d193e5998f1ad4ebeabfabe71113d87119532a45479a4edb7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "邯鄲反言，父兄生患。竟涉憂恨，卒死不還。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b0ac911a9fed9fcfa28fb7fd4450a8fa95257e18ba4627ba98c5565a84442db3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:20381f2611f364414953c1fd630d8ad9a8e2123e48474208fbaf64ae1857df19"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "玉銳鐵頤，倉庫空虛。賈市無盈，興利為仇。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b5b306495cd9672ac9652ea6e71edd8aedbfc85c98b27b7a60f0578d42f5fe1b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:377d9dd5383f262bb460570db47505f37117665aa3a627fad1c6ccd2fc0951a4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "白鳥御餌，鳴呼其子。施枝張翅，來從其母。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a42eb1c7a8e7f6afb00d1be9df58f933efe07ad638d844334bfee87309a19c8a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dede71e732f7a1e1b2f97d34f8c3458a604da1feea1d2be69fe87983cd1ae1cd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "學靈三年，聖且神明。先見善祥，吉盛福慶。神馬來見，告我無憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e16200d25eb95231dc453feb915eb09a43b18adf0a27bd25b890ac0af4a84fbf",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8b89a539829b3879ce6fd2d259767c80d72c8b4f5eb6a9bad721f628a30dca93"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "雲孽蒸起，失其道理。傷害年穀，神君之精。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:516f93b904ac6b4d6a7ff6f7b9258b0098dff0e14b0042856994bf40d16d59e8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2ca5210e901af44ce904c058cb491a4a5bfdba510b0763cb690710e776dd785d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "春耕有息，利入利福。獻 大豵，以樂成功。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:32274d224a773ca5dee3fcbb917991e5c2fa18ea096e67ffd0e78f32d9021f34",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9b6921c51e2fdc7a5034401bed80964f539141c5043a216a00a0ac104ae7487c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "羸豕躑躅，虎來都邑。遮遏左右，國門敕急。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6ca6877eabc6d63db23860638c7e810501c1a870fcac96d1776d6da9cf5a3798",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:92508cabecd9f147ce98c163d7b07af7a68105e3fdb98a37f5a245e29e6b9b70"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "東行西維，南北善迷。逐旅失群，亡我襦衣。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e6f63014205e1d2428c7522d80ee6504d946bbbe59bfef2678a217c40a1d1cd1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:72e58c4c6297d24a30894e114e678554d4deb3229bc05c3ec5a28cffdf1d3ede"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "居室之倫，夫婦和親。小人乘車，車在夫家。碩果失豢，不知孰是。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:47d49743e918c4cd826d07f10afb8adc620636404083126292b9cb580d5ccff0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a922f5e06056e9f4fb89a29815964147a93648c0fd24e3a1f48646a77712fcc0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "東方孟春，乘冰載盆。懼危不安，終身所歡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:89fda7d2eb97ebab5d556e055d5a918301ad23720aaf7f7c5a9a2d271ca619c0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:aa1792dfa45ae85c32523910467377b024eda0924c3a942f18a6ac80439e492f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "風吹塵起，十地無所。南國年傷，不可安處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c32abbc9c0b1fde9ad8b722c322a06182e8af6947ca600ae525a85ee3972770b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1ad969b9c756e1e9199c17ef8d71773165203983bed16e405ecd31213f175031"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "重載傷車，婦女無夫。三十不室，獨坐空廬。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f237f9f2cfc2bd2f7351a1219bbf5b531b0ec35e08644662bf3732c6ee95c262",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:92fe88bca3971f32fff9251bf5d05c649547e199c238da8c5af6b785fedb883f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "敗牛羸馬，與利為市，不我嘉喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:01d2c2f406da79fb41d3e23d73047d2d63ddd2be53026d6e8ad031affc711edc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7110e82815eaea03ae269dbd67b34af0bfeb942e2c1d98f1875529558ff85b1d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "月出阜東，山蔽其明。章父憂僂，箕子徉狂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:432ebacb6e6e8213930a3b5707c4c8c012d321a6930767aa979fb22b75c43d0f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e6f51729cfbcdc4736f08def804e832d80e3b10d646c0499c951c19899cc9dc5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "出入門所，欲道開通。杞梁之信，不失日中。少季渡江，來歸其邦。疾病危亡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f669e2d4e9d84309b37c82109a33f5fcc69f739278216519e1b628dd647aea96",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:79aa92a4fe0747a096280c833f5b62bb2e93e161e7c22b59b69610c33302d2d8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 35,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "邑居衛師，如轉蓬時，居之凶危。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a6d5968e35cfb4245ef4fbba001dd7ee029e730c0f52095befc36e8337630d20",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:14850210974510f6806dc8728392e8d681452b1041111d47f22cb84467f44033"
    }
  ]
}
